  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanaswiluwu kwakwihi naYerusalema, kuBetefwaji naBetani, kwokumpidi yaOliveta, hakutemesha atumbanji twindi ayedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakuyila nindi, Yenu mumukaia wudi kumbidi wuna. Chimukushikamu, hohenohu mukuwana mwana kachimbulu anamukasi, wakadi kukandamaŋahu dehi kudi muntu, mwakamusubuli mumuleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi hadi muntu wukuyila nindi, Mudi nakwiladi? mukwila nenu, Anamukeŋi kudi Mwanta; yena wukumufuntisha cheŋi swayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayili kwawu, aweni mwana kachimbulu anamukasi kuchisu hanzi munjila kachi hiyakumusubula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu amakwawu emenuku hiyakuyila nawu, Mudi nakusubwiladi mwana kachimbulu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuyileja mwomwayilejeliyi Yesu; hiyakuyiteja kuya nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuleta mwana kachimbulu kudi Yesu; hiyakushahu mahinawu, yena hakukandamahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amavulu hiyakwala mahinawu munjila, amakwawu hiyakuhobola yiputa mumaha, hiyakuyala munjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninawa atwaminini kumbidi ninawa alondeleli munyima hiyakubilela nawu, Hozana! Kisu kisu iwu wukwinza mwijina daYehova! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisu kisu wanta wukwinza wowu watata yetu Davidi! Hozana mwiwulu dakubadika!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwijila muYerusalema nimutembeli lwe; chanataliyi yuma yejima, kwila nimelela, hakwidikamu, hakuya kuBetani nekumi nayedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikunachi, helili anafumi dehi muBetani, hakutiya nzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumona mutondu wachikuyu kwakulehi, wukweti mafu; hakuyaku nindi amonuku nyikabu; chanashikiyi kumutondu kuwana kwamafu hohu, muloŋa hihadiŋi hachila aka chayikuyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuwuhosha nindi, Kufuma kulelu bayi akadya nyikabu yeyi kudi muntu haya nyakaku. Atumbanji twindi achitiyili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashikili kuYerusalema. Hakwijila mutembeli, hakutachika kutemunamu adiŋi nakulandisha, niadiŋi nakulanda mutembeli, hakuhinona nŋimesa jawakwakuhimpa mali, nimatanda anawa alandishilaŋa tutela; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hetejeli muntu kusenda chuma achihitishi mutembeluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyileja nindi, Anasoneki nawu, Itala dami akaditena nawu itala dakulombela nyuza yejima. Hakwinza enu munadibalumuni dehi kwikala iyeŋu dawamakombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akulumpi jawatupristu niansoneki chachitiyiluwu, hiyakukeŋa hakumukisaŋena; muloŋa amutiyili woma, nanochu chahayaminuwu antu ejima kuleja kwindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakufumaŋa muŋanda namelela hefuku hefuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chadiŋi nakupandakanawu budidi, hiyakumona owu mutondu wachikuyu wunomi dehi chau, kufumisha kunyiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petulu hakwanuka, hakumwila nindi, Eyi Rabi, tala mutondu wachikuyu washiŋa, wunomi dehi chau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakuyakula nindi, Mukuhwelelenu Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukuyileja chalala nami neyi muntu wukwila mpidi iyi nindi, Tutulukaku wudinati mwijiya; mumuchima windi kutadika nehi, hakukuhwelela nindi ichi chanahoshiyi chikwila, wukuchitambula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi nukuyileja nami, yuma yejima yimukulomba, yimukukeŋa, kuhwelelenu nenu munayitambuli dehi, mwakayitambula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku ejima chimukwimanaŋa nakulomba, neyi hadi mwinenu wudi nindi nansaŋu, mwanakenenu, kulonda tata yenu wudi mwiwulu ayanakeni nyiloŋa yenu nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa neyi enu mukubula kuyanakena akwenu, nitata yenu wudi mwiwulu hakuyanakena nyiloŋa yenuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwinza cheŋi kuYerusalema. Chadiŋi nakwendayi mutembeli, awakulumpi jawampristu niansoneki niakulumpi hiyakwinza kudi yena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumwila nawu, Eyi welaŋa yumiyi nawantanyi? Indi nakwinki wantiwu wakwila yumiyi hinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakuyila nindi, Nukuyihula chuma chimu muŋakuli, ninami nukuyileja wanta wunélaŋa nachu yumiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chipapatishu chaYowanu chakwiwulu, tahindi chakudi antu? Ejakulenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakudihujola muntu namukwawu nawu, Neyi tukwila netu chakwiwulu, wukutwila nindi, Indi dinu mwalekelelidi kumwitiya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza neyi tukwila netu chakudi antu—! Hiyakutiya nawa antu woma, muloŋa antu ejima elilaŋa nawu Yowanu chalala hikaprofwem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumwakula Yesu nawu, Kwiji, etu kwiluka nehi. Yesu niyena hakuyila nindi, Ninami nawa hinukuyileja wanta wunelaŋa nachu yumiyuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
